title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Sites
route: /authorizations/eligibility
intro: A clinic can run more than one site, and staff at one site must not see the other's patients. Every list, count, search, result and notice in Eligibility & Benefits follows the site in view. A check belongs to the site of its case, and a check made on the Verify form before any case exists belongs to the site in view when it was made.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: sites are placed by case ID in the demo. Both sites is Site A plus Site B. Dr. Rivera sees Site A only and Sam Okafor Site B only (Demo menu, 'Viewing as').
---
start s1 "Open Eligibility & Benefits"
decision q1 "Who is looking?"
process p1 "Jordan Perez or Alex Morgan, both sites\nThe top bar offers Both sites, Site A and Site B"
process p2 "Dr. Rivera (Site A) or Sam Okafor (Site B)\nThe top bar says 'Site A only' or 'Site B only', with no switch\n'Both sites' is not offered"
click c1 "Click 'Site A' or 'Site B' in the top bar"
process p3 "Rows, the title count, the four figures, search, menus and the sidebar badge\nare worked out from the checks inside the sites in view\nThe title gets a 'Site A' tag when the view is narrowed"
process p4 "Totals add up: Both sites = Site A + Site B\nfor patients, cleared, authorization first, fix before billing, re-checks due and the badge"
click c2 "Open a result, or a link to one"
decision q2 "Does the check belong to a site in view?"
screen sc "The result"
screen o1 "'This coverage check is not available at Site A'\nIt names the case and its site, never a patient or a payer\nBoth-site staff get 'Show Site B'"
click c3 "Click 'Check now' on the Verify form"
store st1 "The new check is filed under the site in view\n(Site A when both are in view)\nIts ID, V-1001 and on, resolves to that site on every screen"
decision q3 "Verify re-checks on its own (the Demo clock passes a time)"
toast t1 "One bell message per site\nA message never names a patient at a site the viewer cannot see"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › List › What the screen shows"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The shared verification record"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Re-check on its own"

s1 --> q1
q1 -->|Both sites| p1 --> c1 --> p3
q1 -->|One site| p2 --> p3
p3 --> p4 --> g1
p3 --> c2 --> q2
q2 -->|Yes| sc
q2 -->|No| o1
p3 --> c3 --> st1 --> g2
p3 -.-> q3
q3 -->|Yes| t1 --> g3
